        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2981, y: 2110}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "W sumie to g\xF3wno w tej sprawie mog\u0119 zrobi\u0107.
          Ale pierdoln\u0105\u0107 sobie takiego Graala, to bym pierdoln\u0105\u0142..."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565429
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 06111de8-347a-4e76-ba12-0f970b0a77b9
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 0d33d178-552f-474d-bc74-6c5526fa428b
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 3664, y: 2115}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Chyba ci\u0119 popierdoli\u0142o! Chla\u0107 to ka\u017Cdy,
          ale robi\u0107 to nie ma komu!"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565430
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 0d33d178-552f-474d-bc74-6c5526fa428b
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: c01cdbf6-a741-464e-9d09-54a37f9a8dea
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 4147, y: 2117}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Spokojnie, Andrzeju, nie denerwuj si\u0119... Akurat
          znam kogo\u015B, kto m\xF3g\u0142by nam pom\xF3c."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565431
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: c01cdbf6-a741-464e-9d09-54a37f9a8dea
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 30552c89-1b0a-4424-abfa-8604a52e1b46
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 4725, y: 2117}
        <Text>k__BackingField: Niby kto?
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565432
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 30552c89-1b0a-4424-abfa-8604a52e1b46
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 0eaa7dd9-28d3-45b2-8159-c1ceedf67aa6
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 5183, y: 2111}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Staszek. Przecie\u017C w wojsku by\u0142. Pewnie
          potrafi wytropi\u0107 kradn\u0105cych wino skurwysyn\xF3w z odleg\u0142o\u015Bci
          pi\u0119ciu kilometr\xF3w."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565433
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 0eaa7dd9-28d3-45b2-8159-c1ceedf67aa6
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 8498307a-03c1-493f-bddb-3cf8fba7ba8c
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 5854, y: 2111}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "M\u0142ody, jeszcze raz musimy ci\u0119 prosi\u0107
          o przys\u0142ug\u0119. Znajd\u017A Stacha i przekonaj go, \u017Ceby pom\xF3g\u0142
          nam z\u0142apa\u0107 tego zajebanego kradzieja. Sami by\u015Bmy poszli,
          ale rozumiesz... Prawdziwy \u017Co\u0142nierz nie opuszcza swojego posterunku."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565434
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 8498307a-03c1-493f-bddb-3cf8fba7ba8c
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: a532b9ee-5bf8-4b28-a8b6-5551c753d694
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 6528, y: 2113}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Sk\u0105d mam wiedzie\u0107, gdzie jest Stachu?"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565435
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: a532b9ee-5bf8-4b28-a8b6-5551c753d694
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 403eca90-77e4-42d1-a6c6-b87f90ed371e
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 6986, y: 2109}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "To nie b\u0119dzie trudne. Jak go znam, to le\u017Cy
          najebany na cmentarzu. Odk\u0105d jego szwagier umar\u0142 na marsko\u015B\u0107
          w\u0105troby, to odwiedza go i chleje, jak to m\xF3wi \u201Erazem z nim\u201D.
          Jak dla mnie, to zdrowo jest pierdolni\u0119ty."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565436
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 403eca90-77e4-42d1-a6c6-b87f90ed371e
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 62f877f7-ecdd-4115-aee7-308c5f00c38b
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 7668, y: 2119}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Troch\u0119 szkoda ch\u0142opa"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565437
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 62f877f7-ecdd-4115-aee7-308c5f00c38b
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 191200ec-d3eb-4619-91bd-e6bcc266816c
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 55d763d5-c884-430d-be70-d1013eedbf67
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 8124, y: 2115}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Dobra, m\u0142ody. Wiesz, co i jak. B\u0119dziemy
          tu na was czeka\u0107."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 4904837055787565438
